w offer di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T04:04:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226498","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928070-1840310314354285","game_id":"steam-4928070","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — Tutorial Rework & What's Next","summary":"Hello!This update centers on the tutorial.Tutorial ReworkThe tutorial now begins on a map suited to each character, with cards that carry the mood of that place!These cards appear only in the tutorial.The Ash-Laid Throne Room, the Upper Room of the Empty Inn, the Shrouded Sacristy — we wanted to convey more naturally where each character sets out from, and what this world once was.Propensity / Conscience ReworkWe have cleaned up the tier names and criteria for Propensity and Conscience.Propensit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T14:32:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314354285","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928070-1840310314339527","game_id":"steam-4928070","kind":"announcement","title":"Fire Vow: Dark Fantasy — Free Demo Out Now!","summary":"Hello.The free demo for Fire Vow: Dark Fantasy is now available on Steam.Explore a cursed land, gather resources, and craft the tools and gear you need to survive. Manage hunger and thirst, and shape a journey of your own through the choices you make in each encounter.This demo lets you experience the core of the game: exploration, resource management, crafting, combat, and choice-driven progression.Key improvements made for the demo release* Added a Journey Record to the main lobby, where you c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T15:41:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339527","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928070-1839676055881790","game_id":"steam-4928070","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Page Now Live – Free Demo Coming in August 2026","summary":"Solo Developer: untitled01The Steam page for Fire Vow: Dark Fantasy, a card-based dark fantasy survival game where you must endure the final 15 days of a once-radiant world, is now live.The free demo is scheduled for release in August 2026. The exact release date will be announced once it has been confirmed.We would greatly appreciate it if you added the game to your wishlist.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T07:45:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4928070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4928070":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4928070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z"},"4928140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:22Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4928070","app_id":4928070,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"s